    "description": "BEGLEITER is the award-winning short film about Happy, an orphaned dog in search of a new master, who finds a kindred spirit in Marion (Aleisha Russell), a lonely woman still pining for the man who left her three months ago. But Marion and Happy's new bond is quickly broken when Marion's ex-boyfriend (Brian Taraz) returns. The betrayal is too much for Happy and he decides to take matters into his own paws. Will he find fulfillment in his new life? Follow Happy on his frustrating adventures in search of companionship -- and food -- and experience the world through Happy's eyes and nose as he is led to a new and unexpected destiny by Eleanor Roosevelt and Eddie Haskell.",
